      "text1": "While this scaling could have been an interesting study, the ablations and empirical investigation don’t ask very interesting questions for this to be useful. I didn't find any significant recommendations for scaling tasks that can be reusable in future work or even applicable to models other than T5. Moreover, prior work (Aghajanyan et al., 2021) also studied most of these questions already, in the context of two pre-trained models, though in a slightly different setting. Over this and much other related work on multi-task and multi-lingual learning, the current paper only seems to contribute new results using the T5 model.",
