      "text1": "What the authors call “corpus-BLEU” is actually not the standard version of BLEU (see “Other Comments” below), as the version of the paper looks at n-gram (n=1 to 3) matches between the generated sentences and a large set of references that is not specific to a particular context.",
      "text2": "However, using the corpus-BLEU of individual samples in a fraction creates the potential for completely inaccurate estimates.",
